-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), נספח ו': the agreed text of the special
-- contract for employing a teaching employee with a special reward
-- (incentives), which §53(ב) annexes; and, as the corpus publishes them
-- inside the annex after the contract, the letters the Ministry of
-- Education, the Treasury and the organisation exchanged at the signing —
-- the gradual application, the sabbatical contributions, principals
-- employed beyond 150%, work corners, sun protection for של"ח teachers,
-- the Government's decisions, the extension order and the exceptions
-- committee of §7(ז).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-5`
IMPORT `oz-founding-7`
IMPORT `oz-founding-23`
IMPORT `oz-founding-51`

§ `נספח ו'`

DECLARE `Oz annex ו action` IS ONE OF
    `stop paying the special reward`
    `hear the teaching employee before stopping the special reward`
    `issue the budget authorisations for work corners`
    `bring the Government a proposal to stop the decisions`

§§ `נספח ו' — החוזה המיוחד: הכותרת, הצדדים והמבוא`

-- The title ("חוזה מיוחד להעסקת עובד-הוראה במסגרת תמרוץ ותגמול מיוחד"),
-- the school year, the day of signing, the owner ("הבעלות") and the
-- teaching employee ("העובד") are blanks the contract fills in; so are the
-- particulars of §2 and the period of §3 below. A contract is these
-- particulars, as each one fills them in.
@ref akn:att_14__hc_1/p1 akn:att_14__hc_1/p2 akn:att_14__hc_1/p3 akn:att_14__hc_1/p4 akn:att_14__hc_1/p5 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_2/p2 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_2/p4 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_2/p5 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_2/p6 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_2/p7 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_2/p8
@desc A special contract on annex ו's text, as its blanks are filled in.
DECLARE `Oz special personal contract` HAS
    `the school year it is for`  IS A NUMBER @desc by the calendar year it opens in
    `the owner`                  IS A STRING @desc "הבעלות"
    `the teaching employee`      IS A STRING @desc "העובד"
    `the institution`            IS A STRING @desc מוסד החינוך, and its address
    `the position share`         IS A NUMBER @desc היקף המשרה; 1 is a full position
    `the role`                   IS A STRING @desc התפקיד, where the contract is for a role
    `the subject`                IS A STRING @desc המקצוע, where it is for a subject
    `the special reward's level` IS A STRING @desc רמת התגמול המיוחד, by the Ministry's rules
    `the first day`              IS A DATE   @desc §3: "מיום"

-- The recitals: the owner wishes to employ the teaching employee in a role
-- or subject set as one required under the Director-General's circular of
-- 16.5.2011 on special incentives and rewards ("personal contracts"), and
-- he meets the circular's rules. The circular is not in the corpus: both
-- are facts of the case.
@ref akn:att_14__hc_1/p6 akn:att_14__hc_1/p7
GIVEN `the role or subject is set as required under the circular` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the teaching employee meets the circular's rules` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a special contract may be made on annex ו's text` `the role or subject is set as required under the circular` `the teaching employee meets the circular's rules` IF
    `the role or subject is set as required under the circular` AND `the teaching employee meets the circular's rules`

`why the circular of 16.5.2011 is not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "חוזר מנכ\"ל משרד החינוך מיום 16.5.2011 בעניין תמרוץ ותגמול מיוחדים (\"חוזים אישיים\")"

-- "אי לזאת הוסכם בין הצדדים כדלקמן", and §1: the preamble is part of the
-- contract.
@ref akn:att_14__hc_1/p8 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_1
`the special contract's preamble binds as the contract` MEANS TRUE

§§ `נספח ו' — החוזה המיוחד: סעיפים 2–3`

-- §2: the teaching employee is employed in the owner's service in the role
-- or subject the particulars name (the record above).
@ref akn:att_14__hc_1__para_2
GIVEN c IS AN `Oz special personal contract`
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `whom the special contract employs` c IS
    c's `the teaching employee`

-- akn:att_14__hc_1__para_2/p3 The signatures at the foot of the page, among §2's particulars; no rule.

-- §3: the contract runs from its first day to the end of the school year it
-- is for: school year y ends on 31.8.(y+1), the day included (conventions
-- dates.start and dates.end).
@ref akn:att_14__hc_1__para_3
GIVEN c IS AN `Oz special personal contract`
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the special contract's last day` c IS
    DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 (c's `the school year it is for` PLUS 1)

GIVEN c IS AN `Oz special personal contract`, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the special contract runs on` c d IF
    d `is on or after` (c's `the first day`) AND d `is on or before` (`the special contract's last day` c)

§§ `נספח ו' — החוזה המיוחד: סעיף 4`

-- §4(א): it is declared that the teaching employee is employed by the
-- collective agreements, his salary by his grade and seniority in the
-- teaching employees' scale, with every supplement the wage agreements
-- give for the role or subject, by the rules for teaching employees.
@ref akn:att_14__hc_1__para_4 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_4__subpara_a
`why the special contract's salary is not here` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "ההסכמים הקיבוציים והסכמי השכר החלים על עובדי ההוראה (דרגה, ותק ותוספות)"

-- (ב): on top of it, a supplement called "תגמול מיוחד (תמריצים)" ("the
-- special reward"), at the rates and by the rules the Ministry sets — an
-- input — in proportion to his position, but not beyond a position of 100%.
@ref akn:att_14__hc_1__para_4__subpara_b
GIVEN `the Ministry's reward for a full position at his level` IS A NUMBER
      `the position share` IS A NUMBER @desc 1 is a full position
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the special reward` `the Ministry's reward for a full position at his level` `the position share` IS
    `the Ministry's reward for a full position at his level` TIMES min `the position share` 1

`why the special reward's rates are not here` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "שיעורי התגמול המיוחד והכללים שקבע משרד החינוך"

-- (ג): the special reward is not salary for any purpose: it is not in the
-- base of any percentage supplement, nor counted for severance pay or for
-- the hour value, and no training-fund contribution is made on it. (ד):
-- pension provident fund contributions are made on it, 5% from the
-- employer and 5% deducted from the employee's salary. So of what an Oz
-- salary component may count for, it counts for the pension contributions
-- alone; the Dafna fund (ג) does not name, and "אינו מהווה שכר לכל דבר
-- ועניין" leaves out.
@ref akn:att_14__hc_1__para_4__subpara_c akn:att_14__hc_1__para_4__subpara_d
GIVEN p IS A `what an Oz salary component counts for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the special reward counts for` p IF
    p EQUALS `contributions to a pension provident fund`

`the employer's pension contribution on the special reward` MEANS 5%
`the employee's pension deduction from the special reward` MEANS 5%

GIVEN reward IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the pension contributions on the special reward` reward IS
    reward TIMES (`the employer's pension contribution on the special reward` PLUS `the employee's pension deduction from the special reward`)

§§ `נספח ו' — החוזה המיוחד: סעיפים 5–6`

-- §5: where the teaching employee stops teaching in the school as the
-- special reward requires of him, by the Ministry's guidelines and on the
-- decision of the Ministry's committee empowered to approve it, the owner
-- may stop paying the reward, after a hearing before its competent organ.
@ref akn:att_14__hc_1__para_5
GIVEN `stopped teaching as the reward requires` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Ministry's committee so decided` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `Oz annex ו action`
DECIDE `stopping the special reward` `stopped teaching as the reward requires` `the Ministry's committee so decided` IS
    IF `stopped teaching as the reward requires` AND `the Ministry's committee so decided`
    THEN PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
         MUST  `hear the teaching employee before stopping the special reward`
         HENCE (PARTY `the local authority or owning body` MAY `stop paying the special reward`)
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- §6: the teaching employee declares, by signing, that the reward is his
-- for the school year the contract names only, at the Ministry's
-- initiative and sole discretion, and that he has no claim on the Ministry
-- or the owner to go on receiving it for another year; that does not bar
-- its approval for a further period by the Ministry's guidelines; and
-- that for receiving it he is not entitled to the incentives given to
-- veteran teachers under the map of national priority areas, which was
-- cancelled.
@ref akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6/p3 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6/p4
GIVEN c IS AN `Oz special personal contract`, y IS A NUMBER, `approved again for the year by the Ministry's guidelines` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the special reward is his in the school year` c y `approved again for the year by the Ministry's guidelines` IF
    y EQUALS c's `the school year it is for` OR `approved again for the year by the Ministry's guidelines`

`a special reward holder gets the veteran teachers' national-priority incentives` MEANS FALSE

-- akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6/p2 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6/p5 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6/t1 The signatures, and the signing lines of the employee and of the owner; no rule.
-- akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6/p6 The contract's distribution line (to the Ministry's personnel division); no rule.

§§ `נספח ו' — מכתב המנהל הכללי: יישום הדרגתי`

-- akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6/p7 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6/p8 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6/p9 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6/p10 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6/p11 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6/p12 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6/p13 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6/p14 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6/p15 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6/p16 The Director-General's letterhead, its date (ז' באב תשע"א beside 14/08/2011), its references and the address to the organisation's chairman; no rule.

-- The Director-General's letter on the gradual application of the reform
-- in תשע"ב–תשע"ה, which the corpus publishes inside annex ו (its items
-- 1–4 as sub-paragraphs of the contract's §6): (1) in תשע"ב–תשע"ד the
-- reform is applied in full in 50 upper divisions in תשע"ב, 100 more —
-- 150 in all — in תשע"ג, and 300 more — 450 in all — in תשע"ד.
@ref akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6/p17 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6/p18 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_1 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_1/p2 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_1/p3 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_1/p4
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the upper divisions added to the full application in` y IS
    `by the year of part application` y 50 100 300

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the upper divisions in the full application in` y IS
    `by the year of part application` y 50 150 450

-- (2): item 1 holds on condition that in each of those years the number of
-- upper divisions that may join the reform is not below that year's number;
-- an upper division that may join is one in which 75% at least of the
-- teaching employees who meet the conditions for joining have given notice
-- in writing that they will — §5(ב)'s threshold (oz-founding-5), which the
-- letter restates.
@ref akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_2 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_2/p2
GIVEN staff IS A LIST OF `member of the school's teaching staff under section 5`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an upper division that may join the reform` staff IF
    `the school meets section 5(ב)'s consent threshold` staff

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, `upper divisions that may join in the year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the letter's full application holds in` y `upper divisions that may join in the year` IF
    CONSIDER `the upper divisions in the full application in` y
    WHEN JUST n THEN `upper divisions that may join in the year` AT LEAST n
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE

-- akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_2/p3 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_2/p4 The letterhead repeated at the top of the letter's second page; no rule.

-- (3): in each of תשע"ב–תשע"ד the reform is applied in part in the other
-- upper divisions that may join it; (4): in תשע"ה it is applied in full in
-- every upper division the Ministry supervises.
@ref akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_3 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      `among the year's full-application divisions` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a division that may join the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
      `supervised by the Ministry` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `extent of the Oz reform`
DECIDE `how far the letter applies the reform in an upper division in` y `among the year's full-application divisions` `a division that may join the reform` `supervised by the Ministry` IS
    BRANCH
        IF `a year of the Oz part application` y AND `among the year's full-application divisions` THEN `the Oz reform in full`
        IF `a year of the Oz part application` y AND `a division that may join the reform`   THEN `the Oz reform in part`
        IF y AT LEAST `the school year 5775` AND `supervised by the Ministry`                THEN `the Oz reform in full`
        OTHERWISE `off the Oz reform`

-- akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p2 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p3 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p4 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p5 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p6 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p7 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p8 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p9 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p10 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p11 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p12 The Director-General's sign-off, signature and copies; no rule.

§§ `נספח ו' — מכתב הממונה על השכר: הפרשות בשנת שבתון`

-- akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p13 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p14 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p15 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p16 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p17 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p18 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p19 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p20 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p21 The wages commissioner's letterhead, date (14.8.2011), reference and address to the organisation's chairman; no rule.

-- The wages commissioner's letter on financing the employer's pension
-- contributions for teaching employees on sabbatical: the Treasury and the
-- Ministry are ready to finance them other than out of the money in the
-- training fund, and the Treasury allocates a budget for it; once a lawful
-- way is found, it can begin. Until then the budget serves the welfare
-- fund (§51); once found, from a day agreed, the transfers to the welfare
-- fund stop (what was transferred for the time after that day returned),
-- and the budget, in the same amount allocated to the welfare fund until
-- that day, finances the contributions — §51(ו), which the letter restates
-- (oz-founding-51); and never, for the same period, both. §51(ו) updates
-- the budget from that day at the wage supplements' rates; the letter's
-- "same amount" is the amount on the day of the turn.
@ref akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p22 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p23 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p24 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p25 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p26 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p29
GIVEN d IS A DATE, `the agreed day` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `what section 51's budget serves`
DECIDE `what the sabbatical letter's budget serves on` d `the agreed day` IS
    `what section 51's budget serves on` d `the agreed day`

GIVEN `the welfare fund's budget on the agreed day` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the sabbatical contributions' budget from the agreed day` `the welfare fund's budget on the agreed day` IS
    `the welfare fund's budget on the agreed day`

GIVEN d IS A DATE, `the agreed day` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `both the welfare fund and the sabbatical contributions are budgeted on` d `the agreed day` IF
        `what the sabbatical letter's budget serves on` d `the agreed day` EQUALS `the welfare fund`
    AND `what the sabbatical letter's budget serves on` d `the agreed day` EQUALS `the employer's pension contribution for a sabbatical year`

-- akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p27 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p28 The letterhead repeated at the top of the letter's second page; no rule.
-- akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p30 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p31 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p32 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p33 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p34 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p35 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p36 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p37 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p38 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p39 The sign-off, signature and copies; no rule.

§§ `נספח ו' — מכתב הממונה על השכר: מנהלים מעבר ל־150% משרה`

-- akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p40 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p41 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p42 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p43 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p44 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p45 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p46 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p47 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p48 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p49 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p50 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p51 The wages commissioner's letterhead, date (14.8.2011), reference and address to the Centre of Local Government, the three large cities and the organisation; no rule.

-- The wages commissioner's approval: school principals employed on the Oz
-- reform's terms who, on the eve of their employment on them, were
-- employed beyond 150% of a position ("העולה על 150%": 150% is out,
-- convention thresholds.above) but not beyond 175% ("לא מעבר ל": 175% is
-- in), under the commissioner's approval of November 2006, may be employed
-- under the reform beyond 100%, adjusted in proportion to that position,
-- the reform's week considered. The adjusted positions are set by the
-- Treasury with the Ministry and approved for each principal: an input.
-- The approval is on condition, as the one of 2006 was, that the employer
-- is willing to finance the part beyond 100%.
@ref akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p52 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p53 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p54 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p55 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p56
@desc A principal employed on the Oz reform's terms, as the wages commissioner's letter of 14.8.2011 asks about him.
DECLARE `Oz principal beyond 150%` HAS
    `his position on the eve of the reform's terms` IS A NUMBER @desc 1 is a full position
    `employed so under the approval of November 2006` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the employer finances the part beyond 100%` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the adjusted position approved for him` IS A MAYBE NUMBER @desc set by the Treasury with the Ministry; NOTHING until approved

GIVEN m IS AN `Oz principal beyond 150%`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the wages commissioner's letter lets him beyond a full position` m IF
        (m's `his position on the eve of the reform's terms`) `is above` (150%)
    AND m's `his position on the eve of the reform's terms` AT MOST (175%)
    AND m's `employed so under the approval of November 2006`
    AND m's `the employer finances the part beyond 100%`

GIVEN m IS AN `Oz principal beyond 150%`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the position the wages commissioner's letter employs him at` m IS
    IF `the wages commissioner's letter lets him beyond a full position` m
    THEN m's `the adjusted position approved for him`
    ELSE NOTHING

`why the adjusted positions are not here` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "היקפי המשרה המותאמים, שייקבעו על-ידי הממונה על השכר יחד עם משרד החינוך ויאושרו לכל מנהל"

-- F-oz-founding-annex-v-a: §23 employs a principal of a school applying the
-- reform at 100% "(ולא מעבר לכך)", "למען הסר ספק" one employed beyond 100%
-- on the eve of the signing too, and the letter, published in the annex §1
-- makes part of the agreement, approves employment beyond 100% in
-- proportion to the position on the eve. The reading adopted: the letter
-- governs for the principals it names, §23 for every other (convention
-- precedence.specific).
`a principal at 160% under the approval of 2006` MEANS
    `Oz principal beyond 150%` WITH
        `his position on the eve of the reform's terms`   IS 160%
        `employed so under the approval of November 2006` IS TRUE
        `the employer finances the part beyond 100%`      IS TRUE
        `the adjusted position approved for him`          IS JUST (1.1)

`section 23 and the letter on principals beyond 150% disagree` MEANS
        `section 23 bars a principal from more than a full position in` `the Oz reform in full`
    AND `the position section 23 employs a principal at` `the Oz reform in full` (160%) EQUALS JUST 1
    AND `the wages commissioner's letter lets him beyond a full position` `a principal at 160% under the approval of 2006`
#ASSERT `section 23 and the letter on principals beyond 150% disagree`

-- akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p57 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p58 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p59 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p60 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p61 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p62 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p63 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p64 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p65 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p66 The sign-off, signature and copies; no rule.

§§ `נספח ו' — מכתב המנהל הכללי: פינות עבודה`

-- akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p67 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p68 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p69 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p70 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p71 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p72 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p73 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p74 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p75 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p76 The Director-General's letterhead, date (1.8.2011), references and address to the organisation's chairman; no rule.

-- The Director-General's letter on budget authorisations for work corners:
-- as summed up, the Ministry issues the owners budget authorisations, in
-- the schools joining the reform and by the criteria set (an input), to
-- set up and equip work corners — by the end of September 2011 (30.9.2011,
-- the day included: convention dates.end), counted from the letter's day;
-- for schools that choose to join from the school year "תשס"ג" on — which
-- the corpus marks and reads as תשע"ג — before the opening of the school
-- year concerned; out of the budget set aside for it and under the usual
-- rules.
@ref akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p77 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p78 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p79 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p80 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p81
GIVEN `the school year the school joins in` IS A NUMBER @desc by the calendar year it opens in
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the last day for a school's work-corner authorisation` `the school year the school joins in` IS
    IF `the school year the school joins in` AT LEAST `the school year 5773`
    THEN DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 `the school year the school joins in`
    ELSE DATE_FROM_DMY 30 9 2011

GIVEN `days to that day` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `Oz annex ו action`
DECIDE `issuing the work-corner authorisations` `days to that day` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `issue the budget authorisations for work corners`
    WITHIN `days to that day`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "the Director-General's letter of 1.8.2011: the authorisations for work corners are issued by the end of September 2011, and for a school joining later before its year opens"

`why the work-corner criteria are not here` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "הקריטריונים שנקבעו להקמת פינות עבודה וציודן, התקציב הייעודי והכללים הנהוגים"

-- akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p82 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p83 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p84 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p85 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p86 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p87 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p88 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p89 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p90 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p91 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p92 The sign-off, signature and copies; no rule.

§§ `נספח ו' — מכתב המנהל הכללי: קצובה להגנה מפני השמש`

-- akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p93 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p94 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p95 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p96 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p97 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p98 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p99 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p100 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p101 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p102 The Director-General's letterhead, date (7.8.2011), references and address to the organisation's chairman; no rule.

-- The Director-General's letter on an allowance for protection from the
-- sun for של"ח teachers: as summed up with the organisation, the clothing
-- and sun-protection allowance is increased, by the instruction of the
-- senior head of the clerks' and supervisors' wages field to the
-- districts' treasurers, which the letter attaches. The instruction is not
-- in the corpus: how much, and to whom, is its.
@ref akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p103 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p104
`the clothing and sun-protection allowance of של"ח teachers is increased` MEANS TRUE

`why the sun-protection allowance is not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "הנחייתו של מר בני בנימין, מנהל תחום בכיר שכר פקידים ומפקחים, לגזברי המחוזות, בדבר הגדלת הקצבת הביגוד וההגנה מפני נזקי השמש למורי של\"ח"

-- akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p105 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p106 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p107 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p108 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p109 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p110 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p111 The sign-off, signature and copies; no rule.

§§ `נספח ו' — החלטות הממשלה בדבר הפחתת תלמידים ותוספת שעות`

-- akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p112 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p113 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p114 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p115 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p116 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p117 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p118 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p119 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p120 The letterhead, date (14.8.2011), reference and address to the organisation's chairman; no rule.

-- The letter of the Treasury's deputy budget commissioner and the
-- Ministry's Director-General: the Ministers of Education and of Finance
-- intend to bring the Government a proposal to stop, for the upper
-- divisions, carrying on with Government decisions 3020 (27.1.08) and
-- 4016 (24.8.08) on fewer pupils in a class, and 4018 (24.8.08) and 4275
-- (27.11.08) on a multi-year plan of more teaching hours. An intention,
-- not a duty: the Government's decisions are outside the corpus. The
-- organisation's answer: what the letter says is acceptable to it.
@ref akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p121 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p122
`the Government decisions the ministers intend to propose stopping for the upper divisions` MEANS
    LIST 3020, 4016, 4018, 4275

`the ministers are bound to bring the proposal` MEANS FALSE

`why the Government's decisions are not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "החלטות הממשלה מס' 3020 (27.1.08), 4016 (24.8.08), 4018 (24.8.08) ו-4275 (27.11.08)"

-- akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p123 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p124 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p125 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p126 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p127 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p128 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p129 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p130 The sign-off, signatures and copies; no rule.
-- akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p131 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p132 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p133 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p134 The organisation's answer: its address to the Director-General and the deputy budget commissioner; no rule.

@ref akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p135 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p136
`the organisation accepts the letter on the Government decisions` MEANS TRUE

-- akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p137 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p138 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p139 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p140 The organisation's chairman's sign-off and signature; no rule.

§§ `נספח ו' — הרחבת ההסכם`

-- akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p141 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p142 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p143 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p144 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p145 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p146 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p147 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p148 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p149 The letterhead, date (14.8.2011), reference and address to the organisation's chairman; no rule.

-- The wages commissioner's and the Director-General's letter on the
-- organisation's application to the Minister of Industry, Trade and Labour
-- to extend the agreement to further employers of teaching employees in
-- upper divisions (§63): where their position is asked, it will be in
-- favour.
@ref akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p150 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p151
DECLARE `a position on the extension application` IS ONE OF
    `in favour of extending the agreement`
    `no position asked`

GIVEN `their position is asked` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `a position on the extension application`
DECIDE `the Treasury's and the Ministry's position on the extension` `their position is asked` IS
    IF `their position is asked`
    THEN `in favour of extending the agreement`
    ELSE `no position asked`

-- akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p152 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p153 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p154 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p155 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p156 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p157 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p158 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p159 The sign-off, signatures and copies; no rule.

§§ `נספח ו' — ועדת החריגים לפי סעיף 7(ז)`

-- akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p160 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p161 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p162 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p163 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p164 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p165 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p166 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p167 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p168 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p169 The letterhead of the Ministry's teaching personnel administration, its date (י"א בתמוז תשע"א beside 14/08/2011), reference and address to the organisation's chairman; no rule.

-- The Director-General's letter on the exceptions committee for teaching
-- employees who ask not to be employed on the reform's terms, under §7(ז)
-- (oz-founding-7, which sets it up): its members are a representative of
-- the organisation, of the employer, of the Ministry's teaching personnel,
-- of its pedagogical administration and of its district; its decisions are
-- taken by a majority. On what grounds it gives leave the letter does not
-- say: §7(ז)'s "special or personal reasons", at its judgment.
@ref akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p170 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4/p171 akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4__cls_a akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4__cls_b akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4__cls_c akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4__cls_d akn:att_14__hc_1__para_6__subpara_4__cls_e akn:att_14__hc_1/p9
DECLARE `member of the Oz exceptions committee` IS ONE OF
    `the organisation's representative`
    `the employer's representative`
    `the representative of the Ministry's teaching personnel`
    `the representative of the Ministry's pedagogical administration`
    `the representative of the Ministry's district`

`the members of the Oz exceptions committee` MEANS
    LIST `the organisation's representative`, `the employer's representative`, `the representative of the Ministry's teaching personnel`, `the representative of the Ministry's pedagogical administration`, `the representative of the Ministry's district`

GIVEN `members for the decision` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the exceptions committee decides by a majority with` `members for the decision` IF
    `members for the decision` TIMES 2 GREATER THAN count `the members of the Oz exceptions committee`

-- akn:att_14__hc_1/p10 akn:att_14__hc_1/p11 akn:att_14__hc_1/p12 akn:att_14__hc_1/p13 akn:att_14__hc_1/p14 The Director-General's sign-off, signature and copy to the Treasury's wages commissioner; no rule.

§§ `נספח ו' -- illustrations`

`a contract for 5772` MEANS
    `Oz special personal contract` WITH
        `the school year it is for`  IS `the school year 5772`
        `the owner`                  IS "הבעלות"
        `the teaching employee`      IS "העובד"
        `the institution`            IS "מוסד החינוך"
        `the position share`         IS 1.2
        `the role`                   IS ""
        `the subject`                IS "פיזיקה"
        `the special reward's level` IS "א"
        `the first day`              IS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2011

#ASSERT `the special contract runs on` `a contract for 5772` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2012)
#ASSERT NOT `the special contract runs on` `a contract for 5772` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2012)
-- The reward of a position of 120% is a full position's, and its pension
-- contributions 10% of it.
#ASSERT `the special reward` 1000 (`a contract for 5772`'s `the position share`) EQUALS 1000
#ASSERT `the special reward` 1000 0.5 EQUALS 500
#ASSERT `the pension contributions on the special reward` 1000 EQUALS 100
#ASSERT count (filter `the special reward counts for` `what an Oz salary component may count for`) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT NOT `the special reward counts for` `computing the hour value`
#ASSERT `the special reward is his in the school year` `a contract for 5772` `the school year 5772` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the special reward is his in the school year` `a contract for 5772` `the school year 5773` FALSE
#ASSERT `a special contract may be made on annex ו's text` TRUE TRUE
-- The gradual application: 50, 150 and 450 upper divisions in full.
#ASSERT `the upper divisions in the full application in` `the school year 5774` EQUALS JUST 450
#ASSERT `the upper divisions in the full application in` `the school year 5773` EQUALS JUST (50 PLUS 100)
#ASSERT `the letter's full application holds in` `the school year 5773` 150
#ASSERT NOT `the letter's full application holds in` `the school year 5773` 149
#ASSERT `how far the letter applies the reform in an upper division in` `the school year 5773` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `the Oz reform in part`
#ASSERT `how far the letter applies the reform in an upper division in` `the school year 5775` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `the Oz reform in full`
-- The sabbatical budget serves one purpose on any day.
#ASSERT NOT `both the welfare fund and the sabbatical contributions are budgeted on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2014) (JUST (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013))
#ASSERT `what the sabbatical letter's budget serves on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2014) NOTHING EQUALS `the welfare fund`
-- Principals beyond 150%: 160% under the 2006 approval, financed, may be
-- employed at the position approved; 150% exactly may not.
#ASSERT `the position the wages commissioner's letter employs him at` `a principal at 160% under the approval of 2006` EQUALS JUST 1.1
#ASSERT NOT `the wages commissioner's letter lets him beyond a full position` (`Oz principal beyond 150%` WITH `his position on the eve of the reform's terms` IS 150%, `employed so under the approval of November 2006` IS TRUE, `the employer finances the part beyond 100%` IS TRUE, `the adjusted position approved for him` IS NOTHING)
-- Work corners: by 30.9.2011 for the schools joining in תשע"ב; before
-- 1.9.2013 for one joining in תשע"ד.
#ASSERT `the last day for a school's work-corner authorisation` `the school year 5772` EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 30 9 2011
#ASSERT `the last day for a school's work-corner authorisation` `the school year 5774` EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2013
#ASSERT `the exceptions committee decides by a majority with` 3
#ASSERT NOT `the exceptions committee decides by a majority with` 2
#ASSERT `the Treasury's and the Ministry's position on the extension` TRUE EQUALS `in favour of extending the agreement`
#ASSERT count `the Government decisions the ministers intend to propose stopping for the upper divisions` EQUALS 4
#ASSERT NOT `the ministers are bound to bring the proposal`
#ASSERT `the organisation accepts the letter on the Government decisions`
#ASSERT `the clothing and sun-protection allowance of של"ח teachers is increased`
#ASSERT `the special contract's preamble binds as the contract`
#ASSERT NOT `a special reward holder gets the veteran teachers' national-priority incentives`
